    "abstract": "This is a mod that fixes kerbol's infinite light. In the base game Kerbol's light spreads infinitely even to other star systems this mod fixes it. Most planet packs already include the fix for this but if you are a planet modder and you do not know how to fix this you can use this mod to fix it for you! !!!WARNING!!! I am currently working on making it compatible with mods adding far objects in the Kerbol system like MPE !!!WARNING!!!",
